# Normalise line endings to LF in the working tree.
#
# The Stage 6 mutation gate rewrites source files with LF endings. With
# core.autocrlf=true that leaves every touched file showing as modified even
# though its content is unchanged, which makes the tree look dirty and blocks
# the next mutation run (it exits 2 on a dirty tree). Pinning eol=lf keeps the
# working tree and the index in agreement.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.pdf binary
